24
00:03:12,532 --> 00:03:16,348
[Host] It means hard — not soft, like a rock or a shell.

25
00:03:16,948 --> 00:03:24,003
[Slow] あぶないとき、体を丸めて、ボールのようになります。

26
00:03:24,804 --> 00:03:29,460
[Host] When there is danger, it rolls up its body and becomes like a ball.

27
